                                p IJMPA congratulates Prof. Rainer Weiss, Prof. Barry C. Barish and Prof. Kip S. Thorne who have been awarded the 2017 Nobel Prize in Physics for decisive contributions to the LIGO detector and the observation of gravitational waves. A paper contributed by Prof. Barry Barish and Prof. James E. Brau and other selected papers on Gravitational Waves are now free for read on World Scientific website.
